{"channelId":"UCYdmyZnrfQWNQnRKL8eXdXQ","row":["Freyja's Friends Small Farm Animal Rescue",227,"We are a nonprofit (501c3) rescue and sanctuary for small farm animals. Located in Southern California.\n\nWe help animals and people, as well. The unwanted and the broken need someone to love them. Repurposing gives purpose to something that was seemingly “useless.” I wanted to feel that I still had purpose, so I give that feeling to others whenever I can. \n\nBecome one of Freyja’s Friends at freyjasfriends.org and inquire how donate time, money, supplies, or advice. Find us on Facebook and Instagram. https://www.facebook.com/jennifer.rescuer?mibextid=wwXIfr is monetized, so like, comment, and share to help for free!\n\nIt’s okay to not be okay sometimes. You and other animals don’t have to be thrown away, you still have purpose.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYdmyZnrfQWNQnRKL8eXdXQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYdmyZnrfQWNQnRKL8eXdXQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:48.939Z","channelId":"UCYdmyZnrfQWNQnRKL8eXdXQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"4333d5de5fde3bb900263f4a9b1c8ecfea3a6d5f1fea74c3da5faff7b7f81a52","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"3fe865986c8d7bc743d719f4e84b2bb74428dc6d900cfc11f22d5a813bb8cf7f"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYdmyZnrfQWNQnRKL8eXdXQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":227,"raw":"227 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYdmyZnrfQWNQnRKL8eXdXQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:48.939Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":